[{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1108],"value":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1109],"value":4},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1110],"value":28},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1111],"value":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1112],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"新的一周又开始了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对我而言，哪天上学，哪天不上学都没什么区别。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"都是和春原在一起，聊聊天，浪费浪费时间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只不过，在学校里有个能让我安心的地方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这是最让我感激的事情。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg028"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",311],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嘿。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk11a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「朋也前辈，欢迎光临～」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「今天只有你一个人吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是啊，春原那笨蛋，心情正低落着呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「心情低落吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「那我更希望他能来这里了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk13a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「来这里喝喝茶，放松放松。我想心情也会有所好转的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你说得对。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk11a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「是吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「但前提是能和你那些朋友友好相处。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「一定能的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"宫泽合上手里的书，站了起来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「午饭吃了没有？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「还没呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「那我随便做点什么吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我说啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「请说。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这里到底是什么地方？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「资料室啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那你要在这里干什么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「做午饭。就做些简单的东西。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么做？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「这里炊具还是很全的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「为什么会有炊具啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「因为需求还挺多的，所以我就准备了一套。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「炒饭可以吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「吃的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"算了，不管了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"乒乒乓乓…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"碟子和勺子碰撞的声音在教室里回响。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「味道怎么样？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「超好吃。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「谢谢你的夸奖。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"资料室里，一个看着书的女生面前，坐着一个拿着勺子吃炒饭的男人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（…这场景太诡异了吧。）"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「多谢款待。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「嗯，不客气。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没客气，没客气。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk11a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「如果还有什么要求，只要和我说，我会尽量准备好的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你干脆把这开成咖啡厅得了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「我这里可没那么高档。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我看未必…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"望向窗外。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"湛蓝晴空中没有一片云朵。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我发了一会呆。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从走廊依稀传来女生们的笑声。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过，这里真是舒服啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk11a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「是吗。你能这样说我很高兴。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"发生了那样的事情，这里依旧能让我感觉舒心。这应该都是她散发出来的氛围的功劳吧。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我开始明白那些聚集在她身边的人的心情了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"每当我开口，宫泽都会看着我微微一笑。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"即使她拥有一张生来就倔强的脸庞。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"即使从我嘴里吐露的是不满和抱怨。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「这个…给你…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"临别时，她拿了一包用手绢包着的小包给我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这是什么？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「这是给春原前辈的。我炒饭特意多做了一点。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…好的。我会交给他的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「还有，请你一定要教他能让人开心的魔咒。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说完，她拿出那本书，翻到了某一页。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「我现在就教你怎么做，也请你一定要教给他。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好…好…」"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg021"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",314],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「春原…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「啊？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你站起来，站直了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「干什么啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你别多问。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原拉起椅子，一脸不满地站了起来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我站好了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你站着不要动啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「知道啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不管发生什么，都绝对不能动。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「干什么啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那我开始了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你要开始什么了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我两腿微微张开，半蹲了下来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"以一种相扑比赛的姿势，把自己的手搭在了春原的胸脯上。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「呼…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我紧紧闭上双眼，深深地吸了一口气。然后…"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「注入元气弹！注入元气弹！注入元气弹！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我大声地叫到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「咳咳…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我恢复了正常的姿势。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「冈崎，你…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「…是不是撞到脑袋了？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你把人家的好心好意当成什么啦！混球ーーー！！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我一把抓住他的领子，来回摇晃。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哇哇哇哇…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「早知道我就不教你了！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「咳…换别人来也是我这种反应的好吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这是魔咒！你猜也能猜到吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「啊？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「…魔咒…也就是说，是有纪宁妹妹教的？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「对啊。她说是能让人开心的魔咒。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「他还让我一定要记住，然后教给你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「毕竟吃人嘴短，我也不好意思拒绝…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「可恶…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「…不过也就是说，刚才你给我的元气弹，是有纪宁妹妹注入给你的？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…对啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我突然感觉整个人都有精神了！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过因为剧烈的摇晃，又全都跑光了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「啊啊，元气弹，元气弹…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…你以为你在找眼镜啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh17"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「还给我，你还给我！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这东西你要我怎么还！再说到底什么是元气弹啊！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我哪知道！是你注入给我的好吗！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是我给你的，可我也不知道好吗！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不知道是什么你也敢随便给我！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「就是给了又怎么样！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「可恶，好想再要一个啊！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦，已经没货了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh17"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「可恶啊。话说你是被有纪宁妹妹注入的对吧！？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没错，超舒服的！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「啊啊，我也好想被注入啊！」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg021a"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「喂，你们两个变态。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「什么事？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"教师","text":"「上课了。你们给我坐下。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回过神来，我发现全班人都注视着我们两个。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我说，你羞不羞啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你不也一样？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「对了，这个给你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"坐下后，我把手绢包着的小包扔给了春原。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「什么啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原解开手绢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"里面是一个小小的便当盒。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他打开盖子。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh26"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"流下了感动的泪水。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg021b"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我好感动啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「这炒饭…是不是有纪宁妹妹亲手炒的？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不是，是我用脚炒的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「呕…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「骗你的。的确是宫泽亲手炒的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你的那声呕…，我会转告她的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「还不是你说是你用脚炒的！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「用脚怎么炒啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「这…这是有纪宁妹妹亲手做给我的啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「有纪宁妹妹真是个好女孩啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「之前抱着提高自身价值的想法接近她，我真是个大傻瓜。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「从今以后，我要慢慢去喜欢她…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯，我又有精神了！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「元气弹，吸出！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「喂，不要抽掉啊！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这东西能吸出来就有鬼了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好了，我要去向她道声谢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这家伙真是现实。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":250,"condition":["==",["v","f",17],1]},{"op":"background","image":"bg018"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「对了。你妹妹呢？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"途中，我突然想起这件事，随口问了一句。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哦，她现在在美佐枝小姐的房间里。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「也就是说…你在宿舍的堕落生活被她看了个遍对吧…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那又怎么样。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「重要的是我有精神了。我要从有纪宁妹妹那里直接注入元气，然后告诉她。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「只要有精神，什么都做得到。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh21"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「大家，真有精神啊ーーーー！！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你说什么感想啊，你倒是问啊。」"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg028"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",311],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「真的，我好感动啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk11a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「我要谢谢你。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「是我要谢谢你。炒饭也特别好吃。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「只要你能打起精神，就比什么都好。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「其实我…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「其实我想你直接给我做那个能让人打起精神的魔咒…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk15a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「那个我做不了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「为什么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「因为，实在太羞人了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「我最多也只能做一次。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，你那时候脸都通红了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk18a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「请不要说出来。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「啊，我也好想看到这一幕啊！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"砰！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"窗户又一次伴随着巨响，被打开了。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",321],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「春原，你怎么办…开逃吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我…我会当作什么都没发生一样的…一切都是为了和有纪宁妹妹搞好关系…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不。我要积极地和他们成为朋友…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嚯，好大的气概啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"男人","text":"「嘿，有纪宁姐。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「你好，藤堂同学。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"男人","text":"「好久不见ー」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「真的好久不见了呢，榎本同学。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"男人","text":"「这个人就是有纪宁姐吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「哎呀，是新朋友啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"男人","text":"「喂，你怎么也来了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「大冢同学你好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"男人","text":"「呀吼，小纪纪。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「草苅同学你好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"男人","text":"「生意挺好的呀？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「一般般吧，深泽同学。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"男人","text":"「唉，今天真热闹啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「没关系，这个教室地方很大的。来坐一会吧，沟口同学。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"男人","text":"「有纪宁姐你听我说。我伤口的数量又变多了。」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["＊Ａ"]]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":305,"condition":["==",["v","s",0],"蛭子"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1090],"value":1},{"op":"goto","to":306},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1090],"value":0},{"op":"ifFalse","to":309,"condition":["==",["v","f",1090],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「已经是第１００１个了啊，江之川同学。」"},{"op":"goto","to":311},{"op":"ifFalse","to":311,"condition":["==",["v","f",1090],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「已经是第１００１个了啊，蛭子同学。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「我去给大家泡咖啡。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「看来你今天能交到许多朋友呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好…好像是的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「话说，他们真的全都没被老师发现吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我怎么感觉他们是排着队过来的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唰地一下，教室的门开了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「这里怎么这么吵啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"老师从门外朝里面张望。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我急忙回头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后…"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk15a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「老师，对不起。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那里只有宫泽一人，脸上满是苦笑。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和春原简直不敢相信自己的眼睛。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"教师","text":"「哦，原来是你们几个…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"教师","text":"「别在这里磨磨蹭蹭的，早点回去。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"老师对着我和春原说完，就关上门，离开了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「呃…那些朋友呢…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk11a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「他们都在啊。」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",311],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"男人","text":"「哎呀…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"男人","text":"「这里实在是太小了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"男人","text":"「小子，刚才是不是你踢的我？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一个个的从桌子底下爬了出来…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你是怎么区分老师来还是他们来的…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk11a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「经验吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「真神了…」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":434,"condition":["==",["v","f",204],1]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「对了，我想到了个好办法，能和他们交上朋友。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你们等着，我这就去把人领来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你要领谁来？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原不回答我的问题，只是坏笑一下，走出了资料室。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「来，请进吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我去给你泡个咖啡。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原回来了，他领来的是…"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我可没想要待那么长时间啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…是智代。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"男人","text":"「呜哇！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"其中一个不良少年注意到了她，发出了惨叫。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"男人","text":"「智，智代姐。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"房间里鸦雀无声。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",310],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「你们…这可都是…好久不见了呀。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代这样说到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"其中几个人粗声大气地向她问好。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真是一副壮观的景象…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那么…你想要做什么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她问春原。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我们不是朋友嘛？所以啊，就想请你过来一道喝个茶。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「这我可是一个字都没听说过哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「再说了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我跟你又不是朋友。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「唉唉ーーーーーーーー！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「说什么呢，我们不是关系挺好的嘛？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这家伙…知道不良少年怕智代，打算显摆她跟自己的关系，来提升自己的地位吧。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你试着回忆一下吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我们不是经常有说有笑的嘛。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「有时候还互相打来打去，闹来闹去的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「哦，这样啊。对你来说，那种行为叫做说说笑笑，打打闹闹啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那么，要不要我在闹你一下啊？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯，来嘛来嘛。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":12},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":12},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1016],"value":"咚！"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":12},{"op":"callScene","scene":9071,"entry":2},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「来吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我说，你的形象变得相当吓人了啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「这种踢击…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「该不会，你就是坂上同学吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「为什么我在这里会这么出名呢？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「就放我安静一会儿吧…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她垂着肩，离开了资料室。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",311],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你果然听说过她啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「是的。虽然都是传说，但她的英勇事迹我还真听过不少呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgyk11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"宫泽","text":"「我一直想和她聊一聊。要是今后能有时间畅谈就好了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可看她的样子，估计不会再来第二次了…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我可是她朋友啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我说你啊，脸上有个鞋印还说这种话，很吓人的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这一天，直到最后，我们都只能在一边旁观闹剧。"},{"op":"goto","to":437},{"op":"ifFalse","to":437,"condition":["==",["v","f",204],0]},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这一天，我们只能在一边旁观闹剧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在这些个人的包围下，依然能够保持笑容的平凡女孩…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真是一副奇妙的景象。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"jumpScene","scene":5430,"entry":0},{"op":"return"}]